  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np8:2.1.4": "For an explanation of this, see comment at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-np4/en/brahmali#2.1.6'>Bu NP 4:2.1.6</a>. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np8:2.1.5": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np8:2.1.6": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Agāraṁ</i> is typically rendered as “in a house”. The problem with this is that it is not unallowable for a monastic to live in a building that is the equivalent of a house. What a monastic should not do is own a home and then live there. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np8:2.1.7": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np8:2.1.8": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np8:2.1.9": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-np8:2.1.10": "“Money” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>hirañña</i>.  See Appendix of Technical Terms for discussion. ",
